# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/), and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [0.2.0] 2024-05-05

### Added
 - Satus screen
 - table with all accounts on the db
 - copy to clipboard username and password
 - add play, stop and open browser buttons
 - play start script with the account setted
 - stop, stop the script if the account already started
 - put a status indicator if the bot is playing or not
 - add openbrowser button that launch chrome and give the user 4 min to input whatever on a porxy chrome


## [0.1.0] - 2024-04-20

### Added
- Initial window and folder structure
- Initial window and menu structure
- Client music support
- Firebase firestore connection
- Add homepage
- Native window code support
- Core character,proxies,skills models
